  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#xbf;Enabling Pivotal Energy Investments in Central America&#xbf; (EPEICA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: &#xbf;Enabling Pivotal Energy Investments in Central America&#xbf; (EPEICA) - The Overall Objective of this action is to improve the conditions for European investment, growth, and progress of the MER in line with the Global Gateway Investment Agenda (GGIA), while aiding to the Central American energy transition and electrical integration. The Specific Objectives of this action are: 1. Strengthened enabling environment for integrated energy planning, policy, and market frameworks to facilitate European investments in renewable energy and grid development in the MER at national, regional and extra-regional levels; and 2. Accelerated renewable energy project development through strengthened European private-sector engagement and access to finance in Central America.</narrative>
  </description>
